Geist-1.7.2.woff2      upstream Geist/webfonts/Geist[wght].woff2
GeistMono-1.7.2.woff2  upstream GeistMono/webfonts/GeistMono[wght].woff2

Both files are the unmodified variable woff2 faces from the release archive, renamed
only because square brackets are not legal unencoded in a URL path and Tomcat rejects a
request target carrying them. The version is in the file name so the served URL can be
cached immutably; bump both together with this file.
